    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>主播 | 沈词 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;B端Saas产品经理</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾 | 星星 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;AI语音产品经理、情侣摄影师</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>十分巧合的是，本期主播和嘉宾都是建筑学专业（难民），并且都转行了互联网产品经理，本期的节目和往常不太一样，没有讲和具体某个行业相关的内容，更多聚焦于上学、转行以及副业的相关经历，单纯就是随意得聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span>整个对话，也正如某日饭后，朋友间的闲聊一样，漫无目的；一切都是最好的安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a>:建筑学读研的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">00:06:02</a>:主播的转行互联网产品经理的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">00:13:10</a>:填志愿选建筑原来是因为不想学数学！后悔不已</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a>:第一份产品运营实习——电商搜索评测打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">00:20:43</a>:为转行互联网学了线上课程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">00:23:47</a>:将爱好转化为副业——情侣摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">00:27:33</a>:摄影带来产品工作给不到的满足感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">00:32:37</a>:建筑学、产品经理与摄影的关联性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">00:33:49</a>:选择与命运：接种建筑学与遇见男友的巧合经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span><a href="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=k5DX0OR" data-url="https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=k5DX0OR"><span>FIVE NEW OLD (ファイブ・ニュー・オールド)-Ghost In My Place</span></a></p>]]></description>
